    <string name="profile_privacy_title">Privacy and data</string>
    <string name="profile_privacy_message">Bud-Jet stores your finance records locally on this device.\n\nIf you turn on automatic tracking, Bud-Jet reads payment notifications from the apps you choose. They are processed only on this device; their text is not sent anywhere.\n\nWhen you export or backup data, files are created only in the location you choose.\n\nBud-Jet does not send your transactions, notes, goals, or categories to a remote server.\n\nThe only exception is the AI assistant (Pro plan). It is off by default. Only after you turn it on and agree, the app sends a summary to our AI service when you ask for tips or a question: totals by category and month, limits and your savings goal, plus your question. Never sent: notes, notification texts, store names, bank or card details. The summary is used only to answer and is not stored. Turn the assistant off in Profile and nothing is sent again.\n\nPayments are handled by Google Play; Bud-Jet never sees your card.</string>

